02:0004807C 00048090        	  4310:     dc.l    ReverseObjDir   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
02:00048080 00048096        	  4311:     dc.l    Walker_AltDir_EndLoop   ; jump table entry (32-bit for _m68k_tablejump)
